00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,924
A warning.

2
00:00:00,924 --> 00:00:05,520
Many books still teach the starch sugar theory of stomatal opening.

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,679
It is history.

4
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:15,091
Onion guard cells contain no starch at all, yet they open and close perfectly well, using potassium chloride.

5
00:00:15,091 --> 00:00:17,591
In the exam, write about potassium.

